# .templateoverrides — acknowledge intentional divergence from the Spernakit template baseline.
# Format:  ACTION  PATH  [# REASON]   (ACTION = SKIP | KEEP | DELETED)
#   KEEP/SKIP  suppress drift on a file we intentionally maintain locally
#   DELETED    suppress "missing-in-app" for a template file we intentionally removed

# The API route-registration hub. Every SMB-domain feature must register its Elysia
# routes here (this is the single wiring point, exactly as the template registers its
# own auth/users/etc. routes). Our additions to the routePlugins chain are intentional
# and required; keep our version rather than the stock template baseline.
KEEP  backend/src/create-api-app.ts  # register SMB asset-domain routes (asset-inventory-api)

# The settings tab list is the single wiring point for settings sub-pages (the
# template hardcodes its own Application/Auth/Users/etc. tabs here). Adding the
# Infrastructure domain settings tab requires editing this pure file; keep our
# version rather than the stock template baseline.
KEEP  frontend/src/pages/settings/SettingsLayout.tsx  # register Infrastructure settings tab (admin-settings)
